# Rails Backend

## API controllers

- Live under `app/controllers/api/v1/`
- Inherit `Api::V1::BaseController` (`ActionController::API`)
- Use `Paginatable` for offset pagination (`page`, `per_page`, max 100)
- Search uses Ransack + Kaminari in `SearchController`
- Prefer `includes`/`joins` to avoid N+1 in index/show actions

## Models

- `Word` — core entity; links to `WordSet` (HABTM), `Tag`, `FrequencyTable`, `Dictionary::Entry`
- `Dictionary::*` — JMDict data under `dictionary_` table prefix
- Validations: `Word#content` and `Tag#name` are unique; use sequences in factories

## JSON views

- Partials in `app/views/api/v1/`
- Word payload: `id`, `content`, `kana`, `word_count`, `reading`, `tags`, `frequencies`
- Dictionary entries: `text`, `readings`, `senses[{tags, definitions}]`

## Style

- `# frozen_string_literal: true` on controllers
- Keep business logic in models/services, not controllers
